{"4185070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Holylands: War of Faith", "steam_appid": 4185070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Lands</strong> is a Third person Shooter set in Al-Aqsa area and the historic Old City of Jerusalem — a virtual space where players can explore the area of Al-Aqsa and the Old City , Fight and seek for truth and human unity .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the world’s first <strong>Game</strong> set entirely in one of the most meaningful places on earth.  People gather to stand with resistance through knowledge, awareness and voice of freedom that stands with Knowledge and light .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/52d295c4567086560d19bacc30949789.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Beautiful Dome of the Rock View\" width=608 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/52d295c4567086560d19bacc30949789.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/52d295c4567086560d19bacc30949789.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living Beginning — A Growing Vision .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Holy Lands </strong>brings up Resistance Ideas in the Old City in Jerusalem through the ages, it defines the important of exploring new knowledges . it's the World's first game set  in Jerusalem - Old City, where players Play in Aqsa Area and Old City for spreading peace and the voice of freedom in all over the world , this game stands with Resistance ideas, Truth Reveal , light upon dark !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/0f0efc971243cfc8470f21532a006f7e.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Real Aqsa Area Design \" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/0f0efc971243cfc8470f21532a006f7e.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/0f0efc971243cfc8470f21532a006f7e.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Holy Lands </strong> have a combat type gameplay that brings it up to players who want to stimulate Resistance Combat, with a good weapons and a Good AI enemy to fight back, it can be expressed as a Survival game as long as the player can stand up Against the AI enemies .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/2ee8574dc0d7b4781341c1bf76f9de74.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Gunfight in Old city 1\" width=608 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/2ee8574dc0d7b4781341c1bf76f9de74.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/2ee8574dc0d7b4781341c1bf76f9de74.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Holy Lands </strong>emphasize the Game development upon making two ages in the same time in gameplay, where the old age is before a thousand year, where Templars and Assassins fight each other in that time and place . We dream about making this happen online PVP .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/5b465cf37030de78bb0fb20297e21cb7.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Holylands Environment\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/5b465cf37030de78bb0fb20297e21cb7.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/5b465cf37030de78bb0fb20297e21cb7.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why This Place, Why Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jerusalem’s Old City and the Al-Aqsa area hold profound significance for countless people. Here, cultures intersect, faiths converge, histories overlap and the future is yet unfinished. By coming together in this virtual space, players step into a living emblem of conflict and hope. Together you honor those whose voices have been silenced, you reveal truths hidden beneath the surface, and you join the movement toward freedom and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/02c00ea52441334d9f9e8429a67bb1e2.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/02c00ea52441334d9f9e8429a67bb1e2.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/02c00ea52441334d9f9e8429a67bb1e2.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Current Features </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Virtual Tourism Experience for Known Landmarks and Sites . </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A  3D social hub set in the Old City .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good Combat survival experience in the Area . </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore emotionally significant and spiritually rich locations .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events, voice spaces and community-made gatherings .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on storytelling, awareness and truth-sharing .</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/3a903aa0d0ec032e2d71ade57fe9b2b5.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Beautiful Aqsa Area 2\" width=608 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/3a903aa0d0ec032e2d71ade57fe9b2b5.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/3a903aa0d0ec032e2d71ade57fe9b2b5.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Roadmap (Solo-Dev Friendly &amp; Honest) </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As development progresses, you can expect gradual updates such as :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Combat system with two ages in the same Gameplay .  </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and exploration features</strong> inspired by Assassins-like design With Two Ages .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat prototypes</strong> with symbolic, non-gruesome “new-age” mechanics .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable story arcs</strong> about resistance, identity, history and people .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Old City districts </strong>and narrative locations .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Online PVP Gameplay With Two Ages and Potential Game Fight .</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/cf8acc4c0075ad2c45eea174a4dab9a6.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Gunfight in Market Area\" width=608 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/cf8acc4c0075ad2c45eea174a4dab9a6.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/cf8acc4c0075ad2c45eea174a4dab9a6.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game That Stands for Something .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is built on a belief : <br>that games can be a platform for peace, for truth, for telling stories that matter.<br>What begins as a resistance idea will grow — step by step — into a powerful narrative experience that shines light where darkness hides .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/b2f07eb49d8d073c620e669f23c6335d.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/b2f07eb49d8d073c620e669f23c6335d.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/b2f07eb49d8d073c620e669f23c6335d.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Walk the streets. Share your voice. Shape the future .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Holy Lands </strong>— a journey from peace to purpose , Two eras , One City , One Resistance  .  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Lands</strong> is a Third person Shooter set in Al-Aqsa area and the historic Old City of Jerusalem — a virtual space where players can explore the area of Al-Aqsa and the Old City , Fight and seek for truth and human unity .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the world’s first <strong>Game</strong> set entirely in one of the most meaningful places on earth.  People gather to stand with resistance through knowledge, awareness and voice of freedom that stands with Knowledge and light .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/52d295c4567086560d19bacc30949789.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Beautiful