 awareness and truth-sharing .</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/3a903aa0d0ec032e2d71ade57fe9b2b5.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Beautiful Aqsa Area 2\" width=608 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/3a903aa0d0ec032e2d71ade57fe9b2b5.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/3a903aa0d0ec032e2d71ade57fe9b2b5.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Roadmap (Solo-Dev Friendly &amp; Honest) </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As development progresses, you can expect gradual updates such as :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Combat system with two ages in the same Gameplay .  </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and exploration features</strong> inspired by Assassins-like design With Two Ages .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat prototypes</strong> with symbolic, non-gruesome “new-age” mechanics .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable story arcs</strong> about resistance, identity, history and people .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Old City districts </strong>and narrative locations .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Online PVP Gameplay With Two Ages and Potential Game Fight .</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/cf8acc4c0075ad2c45eea174a4dab9a6.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" aria-label=\"Gunfight in Market Area\" width=608 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/cf8acc4c0075ad2c45eea174a4dab9a6.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/cf8acc4c0075ad2c45eea174a4dab9a6.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game That Stands for Something .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is built on a belief : <br>that games can be a platform for peace, for truth, for telling stories that matter.<br>What begins as a resistance idea will grow — step by step — into a powerful narrative experience that shines light where darkness hides .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/b2f07eb49d8d073c620e669f23c6335d.poster.avif?t=1775385954\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/b2f07eb49d8d073c620e669f23c6335d.webm?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/extras/b2f07eb49d8d073c620e669f23c6335d.mp4?t=1775385954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Walk the streets. Share your voice. Shape the future .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Holy Lands </strong>— a journey from peace to purpose , Two eras , One City , One Resistance  .  </p>", "short_description": "Holylands: War of Faith is a third-person historical action shooter set in Jerusalem’s Old City. featuring two-timeline gameplay, survival combat and a narrative-driven experience . Explore a story of faith, , conflict, and human struggle across two eras in Jerusalem and human resilience", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/b649779271c7bd724afac559d39ec29e2546a485/header.jpg?t=1775385954", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/373f249c8e2f02e75ccf607dd118e6b9013cd9b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775385954", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185070/373f249c8e2f02e75ccf607dd118e6b9013cd9b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775385954", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / GTX 1650 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400H / i5-12450H or Ryzen 5 5600H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2080 6gb or higher <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Digital Oceans"], "publishers": ["Digital Oceans"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, 